Dockerfile

```dockerfile
FROM eclipse-temurin:17

COPY target/freshbasket-backend-1.0.0.jar app.jar

EXPOSE 8080

ENTRYPOINT ["java","-jar","/app.jar"]
```

Save this file with the exact name:

Dockerfile

Do not save it as:
- Dockerfile.txt
- dockerfile
- DockerFile

Upload it into your GitHub backend folder.

